    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at ticket #88291. Customer says their ceramic vase arrived shattered and they're demanding a full refund. Looking at the carrier sensor logs, the handling data looks totally fine—no impact alerts or anything during transit. \n\nBased on the carrier data and the customer's claim, what's the most efficient way to handle this to ensure we don't lose the customer but also minimize unnecessary costs?",
