      "content": "Given the carrier sensor logs are non-informative, it's essential to request more detailed information from the sender to verify the circumstances of delivery. You can ask the sender to provide additional documentation, such as photos of the broken vase or a damage report from the carrier. This will help you thoroughly investigate the incident and make an informed decision about the refund. It's also a good opportunity to educate the sender on packaging and shipping best practices to prevent future damage.",
